title: Every panel of the left bar opens, one icon marked as its tab at a time
folders: git-changes
expect-log: script: Right\("deps"\)
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left files
wait 500
mark files
wait 500
left search
wait 500
mark search
wait 500
left changes
wait 900
mark changes
wait 500
left extensions
wait 1500
mark extensions
wait 500
left problems
wait 500
mark problems
wait 500
right symbols
wait 600
mark symbols
wait 500
right deps
wait 600
mark deps
wait 500
left help
wait 600
mark help
wait 500
left symbols
wait 500
mark left-symbols
wait 500
right none
wait 500
mark right-none
wait 500
left none
wait 500
mark none
wait 500
quit
